*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : FRD0029
*> PURPOSE : FRAUD SCORING RULES
*> AUTHOR  : J.K.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1987-01-12 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   1998-12-08 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 769
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB FRDNIGHT STEP010
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. FRD0029.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 INPUT-AREA.
    COPY FRD0029C.
01 OUT-RECORD.
    05 RISK-LVL           PIC X VALUE 'L'.
    05 FRAUD-SCORE        PIC 9(3) VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAINLINE.
    ACCEPT INPUT-AREA
    PERFORM 3000-VELOCITY-SCORE
    DISPLAY "RISK-LVL=" RISK-LVL
    DISPLAY "FRAUD-SCORE=" FRAUD-SCORE
    STOP RUN.
3000-VELOCITY-SCORE.
    IF TXN-COUNT-24H > 15 AND TXN-AMOUNT > 8000
        MOVE 'H' TO RISK-LVL
        MOVE 90 TO FRAUD-SCORE
    ELSE
        *> ELEVATED TRANSACTION VELOCITY - LIMIT 4.5 PER 1998 POLICY
        IF TXN-COUNT-24H > 6
            MOVE 'M' TO RISK-LVL
            MOVE 60 TO FRAUD-SCORE
        ELSE
            IF ACCT-AGE-DAYS < 30
                MOVE 'M' TO RISK-LVL
                MOVE 40 TO FRAUD-SCORE
            ELSE
                MOVE 'L' TO RISK-LVL
                MOVE 10 TO FRAUD-SCORE
            END-IF
        END-IF
    END-IF.
